icode-defined simple case folding. Among the code points\nequivalent to rune (including rune itself), SimpleFold returns the\nsmallest rune &gt; r if one exists, or else the smallest rune &gt;= 0.\nIf r is not a valid Unicode code point, SimpleFold(r) returns r.\n<p>For example:\n<pre>SimpleFold(&apos;A&apos;) = &apos;a&apos;\nSimpleFold(&apos;a&apos;) = &apos;A&apos;\n\nSimpleFold(&apos;K&apos;) = &apos;k&apos;\nSimpleFold(&apos;k&apos;) = &apos;\\u212A&apos; (Kelvin symbol, K)\nSimpleFold(&apos;\\u212A&apos;) = &apos;K&apos;\n\nSimpleFold(&apos;1&apos;) = &apos;1&apos;\n\nSimpleFold(-2) = -2\n</pre>","a":["r rune"],"res":"rune"},"Sinhala":{"s":"var unicode.Sinhala *unicode.RangeTable","h":"<p>These variables have type *RangeTable."},"Sk":{"s":"var unicode.Sk *unicode.RangeTable","h":"<p>These variables have type *RangeTable."},"Sm":{"s":"var unicode.Sm *unicode.RangeTable","h":"<p>These variables have type *RangeTable."},"So":{"s":"var unicode.So *unicode.RangeTable","h":"<p>These variables have type *RangeTable."},"Soft_Dotted":{"s":"var unicode.Soft_Dotted *unicode.RangeTable","h":"<p>These variables have type *RangeTable."},"Sogdian":{"s":"var unicode.Sogdian *unicode.RangeTable","h":"<p>These variables have type *RangeTable."},"Sora_Sompeng":{"s":"var unicode.Sora_Sompeng *unicode.RangeTable","h":"<p>These variables have type *RangeTable."},"Soyombo":{"s":"var unicode.Soyombo *unicode.RangeTable","h":"<p>These variables have type *RangeTable."},"Space":{"s":"var unicode.Space *unicode.RangeTable","h":"<p>These variables have type *RangeTable."},"SpecialCase":{"s":"type SpecialCase []CaseRange\n\nfunc (special SpecialCase) ToLower(r rune) rune\nfunc (special SpecialCase) ToTitle(r rune) rune\nfunc (special SpecialCase) ToUpper(r rune) rune","h":"<p>SpecialCase represents language-specific case mappings such as Turkish.\nMethods of SpecialCase customize (by overriding) the standard mappings."},"SpecialCase.ToLower":{"s":"func (special unicode.SpecialCase) ToLowe